---
// FAQ Component
---

<section class="faq-section">
  <h2 class="faq-main-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

  <div class="faq-category">
    <h3 class="faq-category-title">Attendance & Invitations</h3>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4 class="faq-question">Can I bring a plus one / date?</h4>
      <p class="faq-answer">
        Sorry, we are very limited on space and can't accommodate plus ones.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4 class="faq-question">Are children welcome?</h4>
      <p class="faq-answer">
        Sorry, we are very limited on space and can't accommodate children.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4 class="faq-question">What if I have accessibility needs?</h4>
      <p class="faq-answer">
        Please let Freya, our wedding planner, know — email us at
        <a href="mailto:calebgracewed26@gmail.com">calebgracewed26@gmail.com</a>.
        We already have some attendees with accessibility needs and have chosen a
        venue that we expect to be very accommodating.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="faq-category">
    <h3 class="faq-category-title">The Day Itself</h3>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4 class="faq-question">What is the dress code?</h4>
      <p class="faq-answer">
        Formal but fun and colourful! We're aiming for an outdoor ceremony so
        please dress for the weather — and bring something warm just in case.
        We've put together a <a href="#moodboard">mood board</a> showing our
        wedding colour scheme if you'd like some inspiration, but wear whatever
        you're comfortable in. Just please don't wear white!
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4 class="faq-question">Will the ceremony be indoors or outdoors?</h4>
      <p class="faq-answer">Outdoors if the weather allows — otherwise we'll move inside.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4 class="faq-question">What should I wear on my feet?</h4>
      <p class="faq-answer">
        There are some light cobblestones, but nothing extreme.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4 class="faq-question">
        What's the weather typically like in September?
      </h4>
      <p class="faq-answer">
        Here's what to expect in the Kinder Scout area (Met Office Buxton data, 1991–2020):
      </p>
      <ul class="faq-answer faq-list">
        <li>Temperature: highs around 16°C (61°F), lows around 9°C (48°F).</li>
        <li>Rainfall: about 106mm across 13 rainy days.</li>
        <li>Sunshine: around 127 hours for the month (about 4 hours daily).</li>
        <li>
          Wind: average 13 knots, but the exposed plateau will feel windier.
        </li>
        <li>Frost: none expected at this elevation in September.</li>
        <li>
          Source:
          <a
            href="https://www.metoffice.gov.uk/research/climate/maps-and-data/location-specific-long-term-averages/gcqwurrdr"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer"
          >
            metoffice.gov.uk
          </a>
          .
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- <div class="faq-item">
      <h4 class="faq-question">Is there parking at the venue?</h4>
      <p class="faq-answer">No - please park at carpark, [minibus details]</p>
    </div> -->
  </div>

  <div class="faq-category">
    <h3 class="faq-category-title">Food & Drink</h3>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4 class="faq-question">Will there be vegetarian/vegan options?</h4>
      <p class="faq-answer">Yes.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4 class="faq-question">Is there evening food?</h4>
      <p class="faq-answer">
        Yes! As well as the main meal in the early evening we will be having
        some evening food during the party.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- <div class="faq-item">
      <h4 class="faq-question">
        How do I let you know about dietary restrictions or allergies?
      </h4>
      <p class="faq-answer">Please let us know in the RSVP form (to be sent to you shortly).</p>
    </div> -->

    <!-- <div class="faq-item">
      <h4 class="faq-question">Is there an open bar?</h4>
      <p class="faq-answer">[tbd]</p>
    </div> -->
  </div>

  <div class="faq-category">
    <h3 class="faq-category-title">Logistics</h3>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4 class="faq-question">What time should I arrive?</h4>
      <p class="faq-answer">To be announced — details will be shared closer to the date.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4 class="faq-question">Where exactly is Upper House and how do I get there?</h4>
      <p class="faq-answer">
        Upper House is at Kinder, Hayfield, High Peak, SK22 2LJ. All guests should
        park at the Hayfield Sett Valley Trail Car Park (SK22 2ES) and take our
        free minibus to the venue — please do not drive directly to Upper House.
        See the <a href="#transport">Getting There</a> section for full details.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4 class="faq-question">How do we get back to the car park?</h4>
      <p class="faq-answer">
        Transport will be available throughout your time at Upper House for any
        emergencies. Return minibuses begin from 9:30 pm and the last run is at
        12:30 am. See the <a href="#transport">Getting There</a> section for the
        full schedule.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4 class="faq-question">What if I need to leave early?</h4>
      <p class="faq-answer">
        There will be minibuses throughout the day so you can be taken back to
        the village whenever you need to. If you need to drive to the venue
        yourself please let us know via the RSVP form (to be sent to you shortly).
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4 class="faq-question">Where can we stay?</h4>
      <p class="faq-answer">
        See the <a href="#accommodations">Accommodations</a> section for a full
        list of local self-catering, B&Bs, pubs, and hotels, plus taxi companies.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4 class="faq-question">Is there phone signal / Wi-Fi at the venue?</h4>
      <p class="faq-answer">
        There is no phone signal. The venue has Wi-Fi, and we have a Starlink
        dish if you need something critical.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="faq-category">
    <h3 class="faq-category-title">Gifts</h3>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4 class="faq-question">Do you have a gift registry?</h4>
      <p class="faq-answer">
        Yes! We've put together a registry, a honeymoon fund, and a couple of
        charity fundraisers — see the <a href="#gifts">Gifts</a> section. But
        please don't feel any pressure to get us anything; we're just so
        excited that you're coming to share our special day with us!
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4 class="faq-question">Where can gifts be sent?</h4>
      <p class="faq-answer">
        Registry gifts can be ordered through our
        <a href="#gifts">registry</a> or brought on the day. If you'd rather
        contribute to our honeymoon or one of our charity fundraisers, you can
        do that online in the <a href="#gifts">Gifts</a> section.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="faq-category">
    <h3 class="faq-category-title">Photos & Social Media</h3>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4 class="faq-question">Can I take photos?</h4>
      <p class="faq-answer">
        Yes! We're excited for people to share their photos from the day. However,
        we ask that you don't take photos during the ceremony — we want everyone
        to be fully present in the moment. We have an amazing photographer,
        Sarah from <a href="https://www.instagram.com/lyraandmothphotography/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Lyra and Moth</a>,
        who will be sure to capture all the best moments beautifully.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4 class="faq-question">Is there a wedding hashtag?</h4>
      <p class="faq-answer">Hell no.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .faq-section {
    max-width: 87.5rem;
    width: 88%;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 6rem 1.5rem 4rem;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .faq-main-title {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin: 0 0 3rem 0;
    color: #111;
    text-align: center;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .faq-category {
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
    border-left: 3px solid #111;
    padding-left: 2rem;
  }

  .faq-category-title {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem 0;
    color: #111;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .faq-item {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
  }

  .faq-item:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
    margin-bottom: 0;
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  .faq-question {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem 0;
    color: #111;
  }

  .faq-answer {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
    color: #333;
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .faq-section {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 0 1rem;
      margin: 4rem auto 3rem;
    }

    .faq-main-title {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .faq-category {
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
      padding-left: 1.5rem;
    }

    .faq-category-title {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .faq-item {
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .faq-question {
      font-size: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .faq-answer {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }
  }
</style>
